      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INGA JOKER (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (22.89) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. MORAINE QUINN (1) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 390m behind Vinnie Black (23.07) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Goes well out of this box with a win and six minor placings. Shapes as one to consider. PAW YAZ (6) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 6 lengths away in third (22.78) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 over 390m. Expected to feature again. LILLY'S WISH (2) looks an each-way chance.",
